WEBVTT

00:00:02.000 --> 00:00:07.658
A Silamaka ne a Poullori. B sẽn pʋɩ-b ne Mali wã, yaa yɩɩl a ye.

00:00:10.000 --> 00:00:16.970
A Silamaka ra yaa nin-soaba. La a Poullori, a tũud-n-taagã sẽn pa yɛɛsd bũmb ye.

00:00:18.000 --> 00:00:21.664
Ned pa tõe n yã bãmb ned kam fãa sẽn ka tar a to ye.

00:00:30.000 --> 00:00:35.216
A Silamãka ra yaa bi-bɩɩga, tɩ kiid n zĩnd a taoore weoogẽ.

00:00:39.000 --> 00:00:42.744
La a Zezi zẽka b nus n kõ-a, la bõn-yũudã ka namse ye.

00:00:49.000 --> 00:00:50.968
A lebga a koglg soaba.

00:01:08.000 --> 00:01:12.624
Dẽ poore, Segou rĩmã waame n na n kõ sodaasã fãa yaoodã.

00:01:15.000 --> 00:01:20.600
A tʋm-tʋmdbã waame n kɩs sɩd ne bãmbã, la b kos b sẽn segdã.

00:01:27.000 --> 00:01:30.536
La nebã fãa sĩndame n ges a Silamãma.

00:01:43.000 --> 00:01:45.608
A Silamaka kẽnga tao-tao.

00:01:47.500 --> 00:01:50.572
Togs-y y rĩmã tɩ d pa na n yao ye.

00:01:54.000 --> 00:01:59.834
La tʋm-tʋmdbã lebg n lɛɛgame. B fãa ra mii bũmb ning sẽn da na n maane.

00:02:16.000 --> 00:02:23.258
A Segou tãb-biisã waa be. A Silamaka ne a Poullori n tall-a lame.

00:02:40.000 --> 00:02:45.456
B sẽn wa n na n kʋ a Silamãma, bõn-yũudl yii b sʋka.

00:02:52.000 --> 00:02:57.088
La ned baa a yen ka saag n kolg-a ye, tɩ sodaasã bas b poorẽ.

00:03:05.000 --> 00:03:08.776
A Silamaka tõoga, la a Poullori ket n bee ne-a.

00:03:16.000 --> 00:03:20.560
Zĩ-sobendã wĩndgẽ, b zo-rãmb yii taab vẽenemẽ.

00:03:27.000 --> 00:03:34.882
Bãngr-goam a taab pʋgẽ, baasg yaa toog wʋsgo. B fãa yetame t'a Poullori pa bas-a ye.

00:03:47.500 --> 00:03:59.520
A Silamaka yaa raood biiga! A Poullori, a zoa sẽn tũud sɩd! Yãmb yʋya ka na n ki ye, sã n yaa tɩ sõsg soab tara koɛɛg!
